From: spartanz51 <a.m@tuta.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:08:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [sdk] Decrypt a parsed entity with a session key from its
 owner

Blob elements such as MailDetailsBlob, and draft details, have no
owner-encrypted session key of their own; TS decrypts them with the key
of the owning Mail (keyProviderFromInstance). Adds
CryptoEntityClient::decrypt_parsed, which takes that inherited key, or
resolves the key from the entity when none is given.
